  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Customer/Client)\n\n### CAPIUM 365: How to add recurring invoices\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 28 Jul, 2025 at  4:14 PM\n\n\t\tThis article is a step-by-step guide on how to set up and track all your recurring invoices. \n\nNavigation: Capium 365 > Client Portal > Invoices > Recurring Invoices \n\nFilters & Exports: \n\nYou can use the same tools available in the main invoice section: \n\n-Filter by Status (Active, Paused, Ended) \n\n-Filter by Time Period \n\n-Search using client name or keywords \n\n-Export to Excel, CSV, or PDF \n\nManaging Recurring Invoices: \n\nWhen you hover over a recurring invoice, action icons appear on the right side, allowing you to: \n\nEdit - Modify invoice details, frequency, or recipients \n\nPause -Temporarily halt the recurring invoice \n\nEnd - Stop the recurrence permanently \n\nDelete - Remove the recurring invoice from the system \n\nWant an overview of Invoices and other Areas with that? \n\nFor a more detailed guide on how to add or bulk upload invoices, please see the help article below: \n\nhttps://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000268872?portalId=9000044273\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
